{"id": "EUVD-2026-96894", "enisaUuid": "6c4f4162-1d8c-32e6-ac34-fd1c031f8f9b", "description": "Flyte 2.0.1 through 2.0.51 contains a cleartext secret storage vulnerability that allows users with Pod read access to obtain secrets by reading init container environment variables. The embedded secret manager webhook writes base64-encoded FILE-mounted secret values into the SECRETS environment variable, letting principals without Secret store access decode them from the Pod spec.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-18T11:53:06", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/flyte-file-secret-pod-spec-disclosure-20261010", "https://github.com/flyteorg/flyte/blob/5986692d3c31d2f2a8a48593219ae6b73644a179/flyteplugins/go/tasks/pluginmachinery/secret/embedded_secret_manager.go#L389-L394", "https://github.com/flyteorg/flyte/blob/5986692d3c31d2f2a8a48593219ae6b73644a179/flyteplugins/go/tasks/pluginmachinery/secret/embedded_secret_manager.go#L531-L546", "https://github.com/flyteorg/flyte/blob/5986692d3c31d2f2a8a48593219ae6b73644a179/executor/pkg/webhook/handler.go#L168-L189", "https://github.com/flyteorg/flyte", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/flyte-2.0.1-through-2.0.51-cleartext-secret-exposure-via-admission-webhook"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9m8h-33m4-p9vv", "CVE-2026-108728"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "67b266b7-480c-39b8-832f-9f6dab36c966", "product": {"name": "flyte", "vendor": {"name": "flyteorg"}}, "product_version": "2.0.1 \u22642.0.51"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5c2ba13a-0c40-303c-9ac4-60f08d60566b", "vendor": {"name": "flyteorg"}}], "isExploited": false}